sequenceDiagram
  participant UV as uvicorn
  participant L as lifespan in main.py
  participant M as migrate.py
  participant AL as Alembic
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant S as seed.py
  UV->>L: app starts
  L->>M: run_migrations()
  M->>DB: tables exist but no alembic_version?
  alt old database created before Alembic
    M->>AL: stamp 0001 (mark baseline as done)
  end
  M->>AL: upgrade head
  AL->>DB: apply any missing migration (0001, 0002)
  L->>S: seed_products, migrate_legacy_addresses, seed_coupons
  S->>DB: insert only if the table is empty
  L-->>UV: ready to serve /api
